# Common Mistakes

❌ I wake up at morning.

✅ I wake up **in the morning**.

---

❌ I do exercise every day.

✅ I **exercise** every day.

*(or: I do some exercise every day.)*

---

❌ My routine is same every day.

✅ My routine is **the same** every day.

---

❌ I sleep at 11 PM everyday.

✅ I usually go to bed at around 11 p.m. every day.

---

# Band 8+ Tip

Instead of listing your activities, explain **why** you follow your routine.

### ❌ Basic

> I wake up, eat breakfast, and go to work.

### ✅ Band 8+

> I usually wake up early because I find that I'm much more productive in the morning. After having breakfast, I begin my work while my mind is still fresh, which helps me stay focused throughout the day.

